WEBVTT

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.976
I'd be out of a job
if I didn't believe in that.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.096
But yet, where does it end?

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.016
How far do we push it?

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:09.200
How far and how smart
should we make our smart robots?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.056
Thank you.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.360
(Applause)